CM_ "AMK Racing Kit 4WD (KW26-S5-FSE-4Q) - Fixed CAN message configuration, CAN 2.0A, Intel byte order. Sources: PDK_205481_KW26-S5-FSE-4Q 2020/44, PDK_025786_Diagnose 2023/16, Motor_data_sheet_A2370DD_DD5.";
CM_ BO_ 387 "Rear Left AMK Setpoints 1: control word + setpoints (PC -> inverter). Telegram failure monitoring: error if no telegram > 50 ms.";
CM_ BO_ 642 "Rear Left AMK Actual Values 1: status word + actual values.";
CM_ BO_ 643 "Rear Left AMK Actual Values 2: temperatures + diagnostic number.";
CM_ SG_ 387 AMK_bInverterOn "Controller enable (AMK_Control bit 8). Motor control also needs HW RF signal X140 BE1 + AMK_bEnable.";
CM_ SG_ 387 AMK_bDcOn "HV activation (AMK_Control bit 9).";
CM_ SG_ 387 AMK_bEnable "Driver enable (AMK_Control bit 10).";
CM_ SG_ 387 AMK_bErrorReset "Remove error (AMK_Control bit 11). All setpoints must be 0, otherwise the command is not executed.";
CM_ SG_ 387 AMK_TargetVelocity "Speed setpoint [rpm]. Inverter limits setpoints to +/-30000 rpm (motor A2370DD: Nn 12000 rpm, no-load 18617 rpm).";
CM_ SG_ 387 AMK_TorqueLimitPositive "Positive torque limit, unit 0.1 % Mn (raw 1000 = 100 % Mn). Motor A2370DD: Mn = 9.8 Nm (ID32771), Mmax = 21 Nm ~ 214 % Mn.";
CM_ SG_ 387 AMK_TorqueLimitNegative "Negative torque limit, unit 0.1 % Mn (raw -1000 = -100 % Mn). Motor A2370DD: Mn = 9.8 Nm, Mmax = 21 Nm ~ 214 % Mn.";
CM_ SG_ 642 AMK_bSystemReady "System ready, SBM (AMK_Status bit 8).";
CM_ SG_ 642 AMK_bError "Error (AMK_Status bit 9). Diagnostic number in AMK_ErrorInfo.";
CM_ SG_ 642 AMK_bWarn "Warning (AMK_Status bit 10).";
CM_ SG_ 642 AMK_bQuitDcOn "HV activation acknowledgment (AMK_Status bit 11).";
CM_ SG_ 642 AMK_bDcOn "HV activation level (AMK_Status bit 12).";
CM_ SG_ 642 AMK_bQuitInverterOn "Controller enable acknowledgment (AMK_Status bit 13). Reset when motor control is deactivated after an error.";
CM_ SG_ 642 AMK_bInverterOn "Controller enable level (AMK_Status bit 14).";
CM_ SG_ 642 AMK_bDerating "Derating, torque limitation active (AMK_Status bit 15).";
CM_ SG_ 642 AMK_ActualVelocity "Actual speed value [rpm].";
CM_ SG_ 642 AMK_TorqueCurrent "Actual torque current Iq. Iq[A] = raw * ID110 / 16384. Factor assumes ID110 'Converter peak current' = 107 A (KW26-S5-FSE-4Q Imax) - verify ID110 in AIPEX.";
CM_ SG_ 642 AMK_MagnetizingCurrent "Actual magnetizing (field weakening) current Id. Id[A] = raw * ID110 / 16384. Factor assumes ID110 = 107 A - verify in AIPEX.";
CM_ SG_ 643 AMK_TempMotor "Motor temperature [0.1 degC] (KTY84 on X12). Torque reduction default 125.0-140.0 degC (ID32798-11/12).";
CM_ SG_ 643 AMK_TempInverter "Inverter cold plate temperature [0.1 degC]. Torque reduction default 50.0-60.0 degC (ID32798-5/6).";
CM_ SG_ 643 AMK_ErrorInfo "Diagnostic number (AMK ID390), see PDK_025786_Diagnose. 0 = no diagnostic. 3587 = CAN error during operation (e.g. setpoint telegram missing > 50 ms).";
CM_ SG_ 643 AMK_TempIGBT "IGBT temperature [0.1 degC].";
