CM_ SG_ 390 AMK_bEnable "Driver enable (AMK_Control bit 10).";
CM_ SG_ 390 AMK_bErrorReset "Remove error (AMK_Control bit 11). All setpoints must be 0, otherwise the command is not executed.";
