CM_ SG_ 390 AMK_TorqueLimitNegative "Negative torque limit, unit 0.1 % Mn (raw -1000 = -100 % Mn). Motor A2370DD: Mn = 9.8 Nm, Mmax = 21 Nm ~ 214 % Mn.";
